{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-22T21:02:28.620Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.2-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"003810f1fa9492781312030a","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.2-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-22T21:02:28.620Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-22T21:02:28.619Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"## Host behavior\n\n- `not ok 37 - native harness executes all commands and round-trips scoped JSON and TOON renderers`. The old harness passed package cursors through `outputCursor` and let the handler reject conflicting cursors. The host now validates native cursors before dispatch and reports `read_output_cursor_invalid` with exit 2. The native test checks the refusal, resumes through `--cursor`, and exercises the package's own guards directly with the real SDK.\n- The same test previously got package `invalid_input` for repeated scalar options and a malformed output session. The host now reports `extension_flag_value_invalid` and `invalid_read_output_session`. Both host codes and the original package refusals are covered.\n- `not ok 43 - an explicit budget is not refused by an invalid stored budget setting`. A global budget of 1 used to deliver the package `output_budget` envelope. The host now budgets the full delivered output and throws `output_budget_exceeded` with exit 2 and a `required` hint. The package `--budget` refusal, unbounded reads, and the mutation budget checks are retained.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Baseline build and typecheck passed. The full baseline passed 102 of 104 tests. Both updated failure classes fail with a missing expected host rejection when run against 2026.11.14 in a disposable checkout.\n- `pm test pm-unit-sdk-1122 --run --progress` passed 7 of 7 contract tests.\n- `npm run release:check` and `bun run release:check` each passed 104 of 104 tests and 55 behavioral reverts. Coverage is 637/637 statements, 455/455 branches, 123/123 functions, and 571/571 lines. The gates include typecheck, lint, identity and privacy, tracker health, changelog, production audit, and packed npm and Bun acceptance.\n- A clean checkout resolved the initial local merge-driver configuration drift.\n\nCI for this branch is tracked in the Actions run list. [Branch runs](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-unit/actions?query=branch%3Adeps%2Fadopt-pm-cli-host-alignment-1122)"}]}],"before_hash":"ec42cf569b62355333144d27c7ba380e3303d5b7abba440aceff469ae55424d4","after_hash":"4a58ab6ceca56d7c92283ba69b49991e0f78b1b0d8a8a82f48bbd12c9eb40064","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"96ae440c8d6976724027f9ba0b108e5a25a03809165703404a23bc7aaf56d158"}
